1
00:00:55,732 --> 00:01:02,658
On behalf of Northfiels Sports Complex, I'd like to extend our warmest welcome to all here this evening. 

2
00:01:02,658 --> 00:01:10,773
I'm George Dyson, founder of Northfiels Sports Complex. I'm giving this speech today to  celebrate a special occasion. 

3
00:01:10,773 --> 00:01:18,879
We started the business exactly a decade ago, and today, we have developed into a large firm with a sizable group of members.

4
00:01:18,879 --> 00:01:26,997
We've also been nominated the "Most Valuable Company" by Green Town at the yearly Business Awards which will be held next week. 

5
00:01:26,997 --> 00:01:36,617
As experienced and qualified reporters, you are invited here to experience and witness this historical moment of Northfield Sports Complex together with us.


6
00:01:36,617 --> 00:01:46,306
Situated within the campus of Green Town University, Northfield Sports Complex is a modem, refreshing and fully-equipped facility for sports of all kinds.

7
00:01:46,306 --> 00:01:55,006
As part of its commitment to the local community, Northfield Sports Complex is available not only to school children but also to local residents.

8
00:01:55,006 --> 00:02:10,640
It offers a wide range of facilities including a 25-metre swimming pool, paved walking and jogging paths, a well- equipped fitness gym, all-weather pitches, indoor courts for table tennis, tennis and other sports, as well as a renowned skating rink.

9
00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:14,897
Different age groups can all find the right sports to participate in.

10
00:02:14,897 --> 00:02:23,930
That’s why local residents enjoy working out here. As a result, natives here are healthier than most of the people within our nation.


11
00:02:23,930 --> 00:02:32,340
The whole town is very proud of having nurtured two world champions, who were once both trained right here in our skating rink. 

12
00:02:32,340 --> 00:02:36,586
Thus it has become the ideal venue to leam to skate and have fun. 

13
00:02:36,586 --> 00:02:46,078
But what I take pride in most of all is the skating rink that has stirred the interest of boys and girls here in local schools to skate.

14
00:02:46,078 --> 00:02:51,837
Since opening, an increasing number of pupils have been paying regular visits to the skating rink.


15
00:02:51,837 --> 00:02:57,758
A new yoga classroom with trainers will be open next month for mothers with babies. 

16
00:02:57,758 --> 00:03:02,239
They can bring their own yoga mat and work out together with their babies.

17
00:03:02,239 --> 00:03:12,330
This will be a great way for them to get healthy and meet other moms. There will also be a brand new gym open to the pensioners in the near future.

18
00:03:12,330 --> 00:03:19,947
Just this month a new swimming pool is open to all fitness levels with special offers for those without a job.

19
00:03:19,947 --> 00:03:27,588
Our complex is open daily from 8 am to 9 pm except on Thanksgiving and Christmas.

20
00:03:27,588 --> 00:03:30,986
We intend to extend our business in the coming year. 

21
00:03:30,986 --> 00:03:41,139
A list of equipment will be put up for sale ranging from exercising equipment like cardio machines to sports recovery and injury prevention facilities.


22
00:03:41,139 --> 00:03:46,571
Within our complex, we try our best to avoid injuries of any kind. 

23
00:03:46,571 --> 00:03:52,442
We train knowledgeable staff to guide our clients through correct workout regimens.


24
00:03:52,442 --> 00:04:00,051
For those who want to further ensure workout safety, they are welcome to apply to be a member of our standing committee.

25
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:05,475
They are responsible for revising the safety guidelines and supervising its enforcement.


26
00:04:42,758 --> 00:04:49,232
Now I would like to introduce some of our most popular sports facilities here at Northfield Sport Complex. 


27
00:04:49,232 --> 00:04:52,477
Our 25-metre swimming pool is the centrepiece of the complex.

28
00:04:52,477 --> 00:05:08,172
Combining modem, bright and airy surroundings with fully up-to-date changing facilities, the pool is excellent for learning how to swim, improving techniques and, of course, competing in school competitions.


29
00:05:08,172 --> 00:05:15,134
It  is also bookable for private functions, including pool parties, where lifeguards arre available.


30
00:05:15,124 --> 00:05:26,204
Next, we have the only climbing wall throughout the whole town. Many would see rock climbing as a type of extreme sport, exposing great risk to those who participate. 


31
00:05:26,204 --> 00:05:36,229
 But actually, under proper guidance and with close supervision by the coach here, it is a perfect sport for the youth to increase their flexibility and strengthen their muscles.


32
00:05:36,229 --> 00:05:39,723
I have to mention our skating rink once again.

33
00:05:39,723 --> 00:05:46,087
As our most popular facility, it has been prominently featured in a TV commercial we’ve released recently.

34
00:05:47,308 --> 00:05:51,695
There is no other skating rink larger than ours within the whole nation.


35
00:05:52,608 --> 00:06:00,474
Also, our state-of-the-art gym is an inspiring place to train and keep fit in relaxed and friendly surroundings.

36
00:06:01,443 --> 00:06:05,042
The Technogym equipment enables our clients to measure their performance.

37
00:06:06,604 --> 00:06:13,575
If you book a one-on-one trainer, he or she might suggest a future training plan and help you train more systematically
            